ra, arrive at Ye Ran High School as part of their investigation into a series of incidents in Japan. Raizel and Frankenstein conceal their identities when they interact with the duo, but Regis and Seira realize that M-21 is a modified human and grow wary of him. Meanwhile, Tashiro is caught up in another fight with street punks on his way home from school...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/3mzy09QEZqaTnIaEPa1JAlw4LI9.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"48578","synopsis":"M-21 finds himself suddenly blending in easily with normal life. He's even begun to develop some degree of mutual trust with Regis, even though the two of them initially clashed over every little thing. Tao tries to hack into the police department's security system, but Kase intercepts him, and an unexpected hacking war breaks out. Meanwhile, the Union's special forces team, DA-5, finally tracks down M-21's location...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4l3DHx5XUM94kuJ1JVT8V5eiHcC.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"M-21 finds himself suddenly blending in easily with normal life. He's even begun to develop some degree of mutual trust with Regis, even though the two of them initially clashed over every little thing. Tao tries to hack into the police department's security system, but Kase intercepts him, and an unexpected hacking war breaks out. Meanwhile, the Union's special forces team, DA-5, finally tracks down M-21's location...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4l3DHx5XUM94kuJ1JVT8V5eiHcC.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"48652","synopsis":"The Union's special forces team, DA-5, has captured M-21, but he sees this as a chance to search for information on his old comrades. When things don't go as he had expected with M-21, Shark begins to search for a new target... Meanwhile, Tashiro and Seira encounter Takio on the street and notice he's in trouble, and Kase is surprised to find himself hitting it off with Tao, the one he'd gotten into a hacking battle with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHKPISa7TCudqoVDXgbQy5MBDar.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"The Union's special forces team, DA-5, has captured M-21, but he sees this as a chance to search for information on his old comrades. When things don't go as he had expected with M-21, Shark begins to search for a new target... Meanwhile, Tashiro and Seira encounter Takio on the street and notice he's in trouble, and Kase is surprised to find himself hitting it off with Tao, the one he'd gotten into a hacking battle with.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iHKPISa7TCudqoVDXgbQy5MBDar.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"48729","synopsis":"Seira realizes Regis is in danger and rushes to help him. Raizel and Frankenstein suspect that Tashiro and Kase might be in trouble as well, so they follow Seira. M-21 comes up with a plan to sacrifice himself to save all of them, and Regis confronts the danger by his side. The battle against DA-5 has begun! But they're up against the Union's state-of-the-art special forces team, an opponent that won't go down easily...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fTmRaFbR2wc40i5OQnJ8ykwsLIn.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Seira realizes Regis is in danger and rushes to help him. Raizel and Frankenstein suspect that Tashiro and Kase might be in trouble as well, so they follow Seira. M-21 comes up with a plan to sacrifice himself to save all of them, and Regis confronts the danger by his side. The battle against DA-5 has begun! But they're up against the Union's state-of-the-art special forces team, an opponent that won't go down easily...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fTmRaFbR2wc40i5OQnJ8ykwsLIn.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"48832","synopsis":"Frankenstein's battle with Takio and Seira's battle with Hammer grow more intense. Tao and Takio clash as Tao tries to keep Tashiro and Kase out of the conflict, but their leader, Crans, enacts an unb