 Tashiro's plan to get his feelings across to Seira be successful?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/quZxf0fLQBAlXDXWQ7aMehZRQMl.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"48991","synopsis":"Since contact with Regis and Seira has been lost, Regis's grandfather, Gejutel, heads to Japan on Raskreia's orders. Once he arrives there, he unexpectedly runs into Frankenstein and Raizel. Who were the Frankenstein and Raizel that Gejutel knew in the past? Are their true identities finally about to be revealed?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nx3FMYTpwGEy7aI6B3qtqOA67gb.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Since contact with Regis and Seira has been lost, Regis's grandfather, Gejutel, heads to Japan on Raskreia's orders. Once he arrives there, he unexpectedly runs into Frankenstein and Raizel. Who were the Frankenstein and Raizel that Gejutel knew in the past? Are their true identities finally about to be revealed?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nx3FMYTpwGEy7aI6B3qtqOA67gb.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"49061","synopsis":"Raizel and Frankenstein first met in Lukedonia, the country of nobles. Raizel took Frankenstein, who was a noble hunter at the time, into his mansion to work as his butler. Frankenstein protected him for several years, but then some among the nobility who had unfavorable opinions of the duo began to revolt. What decision did Frankenstein and Raizel reach in response to this conflict?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUYY9N17FC8emVZtmMdqRDWMART.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Raizel and Frankenstein first met in Lukedonia, the country of nobles. Raizel took Frankenstein, who was a noble hunter at the time, into his mansion to work as his butler. Frankenstein protected him for several years, but then some among the nobility who had unfavorable opinions of the duo began to revolt. What decision did Frankenstein and Raizel reach in response to this conflict?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uUYY9N17FC8emVZtmMdqRDWMART.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"15409","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"116005","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"41345","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"99779","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"386818","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"49148","synopsis":"Rael arrives at Ye Ran High School to collect Seira per the Lord's order, but he encounters M-12, Tao, and Takio there, and a fight breaks out. Who is this man suddenly confronting the three of them? Seira tries to persuade Rael to leave, but Rael continues to do as he pleases. And for the sake of protecting Raizel, Frankenstein can't just stand by and watch all this carry on...","th